{
  "about": "The Envato gallery's own measures, roles and colours, kept beside its copy of the Jason Armstrong theme because the theme no longer holds them (spec 3.14). Same shapes as the theme's sections. build_gallery.py merges this file into the theme; a key the theme also has wins. Not checked against the master.",
